RANK REGULATION -- DECREE OF KAZEKAGE AUTHORITY
Constitutional and rank archive, Kazekage Office

This decree sets forth the authority of the Kazekage, the highest office of the
Hidden Sand.

Articles:
1. The Kazekage is the supreme shinobi authority of Sunagakure, the strongest
   warrior raised to lead and defend the village.
2. The Kazekage commands all shinobi forces, confirms all promotions, and holds
   final judgment in matters of village law, subject only to the Wind Daimyo who
   funds the village.
3. The Kazekage's person is protected by the guard detail; an attack upon the
   Kazekage is an attack upon the village itself.
4. Succession passes to a worthy successor upon death or incapacity; the office's
   identity is subject to verification, a safeguard born of the Fourth Kazekage's
   murder and impersonation by Orochimaru.

The Fifth Kazekage, Lord Gaara, governs by the creed that the Kage shields the
village with his own body. This decree is upheld above all lesser regulation.
Sealed to the archive.
